{"number":19,"title":"Linear Inequations","slug":"linear-inequations","color":"#0891b2","level":"","estTime":"","description":"Linear Inequations — Class 10 Maths notes, solved examples, online MCQ test and IMO practice on GrowQR.","topics":[{"title":"Solution of Linear Inequations","concept":"<p><strong>What is a linear inequation?</strong> A <strong>linear inequation</strong> is a mathematical statement that compares two linear expressions using inequality symbols. The solution of a linear inequation is the set of all values of the variable that satisfy the inequality.</p>\n<p><strong>Inequality symbols and their meanings:</strong></p>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"concept-table\"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><</td><td>less than</td><td>x < 5</td></tr><tr><td>></td><td>greater than</td><td>x > 5</td></tr><tr><td>≤</td><td>less than or equal to</td><td>x ≤ 5</td></tr><tr><td>≥</td><td>greater than or equal to</td><td>x ≥ 5</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Rules for solving linear inequations:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"concept-list\"><li>Adding or subtracting the same number from both sides does NOT change the inequality</li><li>Multiplying or dividing both sides by a <strong>positive</strong> number does NOT change the inequality</li><li>Multiplying or dividing both sides by a <strong>negative</strong> number REVERSES the inequality sign</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Important: When you multiply or divide by a negative number, flip the inequality sign!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Example:</strong> −2x < 6 → Divide by −2 (negative!) → x > −3 (sign flips from < to >)</p>\n<p><strong>Real-life analogy:</strong> Think of an inequation like a see-saw. Adding weight to both sides keeps the balance (same direction). But if you multiply by a negative, it's like flipping the see-saw upside down — everything reverses!</p>","visual":"<div class=\"diagram-stack\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 250\" width=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"c10c19t1a\">\n<title id=\"c10c19t1a\">Two worked chains: solving 2x+3 &lt; 11 keeps the sign, while dividing by a negative flips the sign</title>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Solving a linear inequation, step by step</text>\n<rect x=\"14\" y=\"38\" width=\"258\" height=\"196\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"143\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#15803d\">Positive divisor &#8594; sign stays</text>\n<text x=\"143\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#334155\">2x + 3 &lt; 11</text>\n<text x=\"143\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8595; subtract 3</text>\n<text x=\"143\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#334155\">2x &lt; 8</text>\n<text x=\"143\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8595; divide by 2 (+)</text>\n<text x=\"143\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#15803d\">x &lt; 4</text>\n<text x=\"143\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">sign unchanged</text>\n<rect x=\"288\" y=\"38\" width=\"258\" height=\"196\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#fef2f2\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"417\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#e11d48\">Negative divisor &#8594; sign FLIPS</text>\n<text x=\"417\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#334155\">&#8722;3x + 5 &#8805; 14</text>\n<text x=\"417\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8595; subtract 5</text>\n<text x=\"417\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#334155\">&#8722;3x &#8805; 9</text>\n<text x=\"417\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#e11d48\">&#8595; divide by &#8722;3 (flip!)</text>\n<text x=\"417\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#e11d48\">x &#8804; &#8722;3</text>\n<text x=\"417\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8805; became &#8804;</text>\n</svg>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 210\" width=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"c10c19t1b\">\n<title id=\"c10c19t1b\">The two solutions drawn on number lines: x &lt; 4 with an open circle and ray left, and x &#8804; &#8722;3 with a filled circle and ray left</title>\n<defs><marker id=\"c10c19m1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z\" fill=\"#0891b2\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Each answer as a ray on the number line</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#15803d\">x &lt; 4</text>\n<line x1=\"80\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-start=\"url(#c10c19m1)\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"120\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"83\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">1</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"83\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">2</text><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"83\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">3</text><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"83\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">4</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"83\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">5</text><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"83\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">6</text>\n<line x1=\"330\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"3.4\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m1)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"78\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n<text x=\"330\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#0891b2\">open (4 excluded)</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#e11d48\">x &#8804; &#8722;3</text>\n<line x1=\"80\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-start=\"url(#c10c19m1)\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"120\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8722;5</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8722;4</text><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8722;3</text><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8722;2</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8722;1</text><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\">0</text>\n<line x1=\"260\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"3.4\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m1)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"168\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#0891b2\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#e11d48\">filled (&#8722;3 included)</text>\n</svg>\n</div>","examples":[{"number":1,"problem":"Solve: 4x − 7 > 9","solution":"<ol class=\"solution-steps\"><li>Step 1: Add 7 to both sides: 4x − 7 + 7 > 9 + 7</li><li>Step 2: Simplify: 4x > 16</li><li>Step 3: Divide both sides by 4 (positive): x > 4</li></ol>\n<p class=\"solution-answer\"><strong>Answer:</strong> x > 4</p>"},{"number":2,"problem":"Solve: 3(x − 2) ≤ 5x + 4","solution":"<ol class=\"solution-steps\"><li>Step 1: Expand left side: 3x − 6 ≤ 5x + 4</li><li>Step 2: Subtract 3x from both sides: −6 ≤ 2x + 4</li><li>Step 3: Subtract 4 from both sides: −10 ≤ 2x</li><li>Step 4: Divide both sides by 2: −5 ≤ x, which is the same as x ≥ −5</li></ol>\n<p class=\"solution-answer\"><strong>Answer:</strong> x ≥ −5</p>"},{"number":3,"problem":"Solve: 2 − 5x ≥ 3x − 14","solution":"<ol class=\"solution-steps\"><li>Step 1: Add 5x to both sides: 2 ≥ 8x − 14</li><li>Step 2: Add 14 to both sides: 16 ≥ 8x</li><li>Step 3: Divide by 8: 2 ≥ x, which is x ≤ 2</li></ol>\n<p class=\"solution-answer\"><strong>Answer:</strong> x ≤ 2</p>"}],"recap":["Linear inequations use <, >, ≤, or ≥ symbols","Adding/subtracting same number from both sides does not change inequality","Multiplying/dividing by a positive number does not change inequality","Multiplying/dividing by a negative number <strong>reverses</strong> the inequality sign","Always simplify both sides before isolating the variable","The solution set contains all values that satisfy the inequality"],"quiz":[{"q":"Multiplying or dividing an inequation by a negative number:","options":["keeps the sign","reverses the sign","makes it an equation","removes it"],"correct":1,"explanation":"The inequality sign flips."},{"q":"The solution of $2x>6$ is:","options":["$x>3$","$x<3$","$x>6$","$x\\ge3$"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Divide by $2$."},{"q":"The set from which solutions are taken is called the:","options":["solution set","replacement set (domain)","null set","power set"],"correct":1,"explanation":"The replacement set restricts solutions."},{"q":"If $x\\in\\mathbb{N}$ and $x<4$, the solution set is:","options":["$\\{1,2,3\\}$","$\\{0,1,2,3\\}$","$\\{1,2,3,4\\}$","$\\{0,1,2\\}$"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Natural numbers below $4$."}]},{"title":"Graphical Representation on Number Line","concept":"<p><strong>How to represent inequations on a number line?</strong> A <strong>number line</strong> is used to visually represent the solution set of an inequation. Different types of endpoints indicate whether the endpoint is included or excluded.</p>\n<p><strong>Rules for number line representation:</strong></p>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"concept-table\"><thead><tr><th>Inequality</th><th>Symbol</th><th>Circle Type</th><th>Arrow Direction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>x > a</td><td>></td><td>Open circle (○)</td><td>Points to the right</td></tr><tr><td>x < a</td><td><</td><td>Open circle (○)</td><td>Points to the left</td></tr><tr><td>x ≥ a</td><td>≥</td><td>Closed circle (●)</td><td>Points to the right</td></tr><tr><td>x ≤ a</td><td>≤</td><td>Closed circle (●)</td><td>Points to the left</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Types of solution sets:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"concept-list\"><li><strong>Single inequality:</strong> One arrow on the number line</li><li><strong>Compound inequality (and):</strong> Overlapping region between two values</li><li><strong>Compound inequality (or):</strong> Two separate arrows going outward</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Real-life analogy:</strong> The number line is like a ruler marking all possible numbers. An open circle is like a \"do not touch\" sign — the exact point is not included. A closed circle is like a \"touch here\" sign — the point is included!</p>","visual":"<div class=\"diagram-stack\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 256\" width=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"c10c19t2a\">\n<title id=\"c10c19t2a\">Four number lines: x &gt; 3 open ray right, x &#8805; 3 filled ray right, x &lt; 2 open ray left, x &#8804; 2 filled ray left</title>\n<defs><marker id=\"c10c19m2\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z\" fill=\"#0891b2\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Open circle for &lt; &gt;, filled circle for &#8804; &#8805;</text>\n<text x=\"44\" y=\"63\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">x &gt; 3</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"58\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-start=\"url(#c10c19m2)\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m2)\"/><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">0</text><line x1=\"172\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"172\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"172\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">1</text><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"248\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">2</text><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"324\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">3</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">4</text><line x1=\"476\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"476\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"476\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">5</text><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"528\" y2=\"58\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m2)\"/><circle cx=\"324\" cy=\"58\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"2.1\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"117\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#15803d\">x &#8805; 3</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-start=\"url(#c10c19m2)\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m2)\"/><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">0</text><line x1=\"172\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"172\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"172\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">1</text><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"248\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">2</text><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"324\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">3</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">4</text><line x1=\"476\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"476\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"476\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">5</text><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"528\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m2)\"/><circle cx=\"324\" cy=\"112\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#0891b2\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"171\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">x &lt; 2</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-start=\"url(#c10c19m2)\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m2)\"/><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">0</text><line x1=\"172\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"172\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"172\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">1</text><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"248\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">2</text><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"324\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">3</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">4</text><line x1=\"476\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"476\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"476\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">5</text><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m2)\"/><circle cx=\"248\" cy=\"166\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"2.1\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#15803d\">x &#8804; 2</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-start=\"url(#c10c19m2)\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m2)\"/><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">0</text><line x1=\"172\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"172\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"172\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">1</text><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"248\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">2</text><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"324\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">3</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">4</text><line x1=\"476\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"476\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"476\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">5</text><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m2)\"/><circle cx=\"248\" cy=\"220\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#0891b2\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n</svg>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 168\" width=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"c10c19t2b\">\n<title id=\"c10c19t2b\">A bounded solution set negative 2 &#8804; x &lt; 3: filled circle at negative 2, open circle at 3, segment shaded between</title>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A bounded set: &#8722;2 &#8804; x &lt; 3</text>\n<defs><marker id=\"c10c19m3\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z\" fill=\"#334155\"/></marker></defs>\n<line x1=\"70\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-start=\"url(#c10c19m3)\" marker-end=\"url(#c10c19m3)\"/>\n<line x1=\"100\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8722;3</text><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8722;2</text><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">&#8722;1</text><line x1=\"268\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"268\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">0</text><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"324\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">1</text><line x1=\"380\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">2</text><line x1=\"436\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">3</text><line x1=\"492\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"492\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"492\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">4</text>\n<line x1=\"156\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n<line x1=\"156\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#0891b2\" stroke-width=\"3.2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"92\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/>\n<circle cx=\"436\" cy=\"92\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n<text x=\"156\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#15803d\">&#8722;2 included (&#8804;)</text>\n<text x=\"436\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">3 excluded (&lt;)</text>\n<text x=\"296\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Integers in the set: &#8722;2, &#8722;1, 0, 1, 2</text>\n</svg>\n</div>","examples":[{"number":1,"problem":"Represent the solution x > 3 on a number line.","solution":"<ol class=\"solution-steps\"><li>Step 1: Locate 3 on the number line</li><li>Step 2: Since it's x > 3 (strictly greater), use an open circle at 3</li><li>Step 3: Draw an arrow pointing to the right (all numbers greater than 3)</li></ol>\n<p class=\"solution-answer\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Open circle at 3 with arrow to the right</p>"},{"number":2,"problem":"Solve and graph on a number line: 2x + 1 ≤ 9","solution":"<ol class=\"solution-steps\"><li>Step 1: Solve: 2x + 1 ≤ 9 → 2x ≤ 8 → x ≤ 4</li><li>Step 2: Locate 4 on the number line</li><li>Step 3: Since it's x ≤ 4 (less than or equal), use a closed (filled) circle at 4</li><li>Step 4: Draw an arrow pointing to the left</li></ol>\n<p class=\"solution-answer\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Closed circle at 4, arrow pointing left</p>"},{"number":3,"problem":"Solve and graph: −3 ≤ 2x − 1 < 5, where x ∈ integers (x is an integer)","solution":"<ol class=\"solution-steps\"><li>Step 1: Solve as compound inequality: −3 ≤ 2x − 1 and 2x − 1 < 5</li><li>Step 2: First: −3 ≤ 2x − 1 → −2 ≤ 2x → −1 ≤ x</li><li>Step 3: Second: 2x − 1 < 5 → 2x < 6 → x < 3</li><li>Step 4: Combined: −1 ≤ x < 3</li><li>Step 5: Since x ∈ integers, x = −1, 0, 1, 2</li></ol>\n<p class=\"solution-answer\"><strong>Answer:</strong> On number line: closed circle at −1, open circle at 3, all integers between shaded</p>"}],"recap":["<strong>Open circle (○)</strong> for < and > (endpoint not included)","<strong>Closed circle (●)</strong> for ≤ and ≥ (endpoint included)","Arrow to the <strong>right</strong> for > and ≥ (greater than)","Arrow to the <strong>left</strong> for < and ≤ (less than)","Compound \"and\" inequalities: shaded between two points","Compound \"or\" inequalities: two separate arrows outward"],"quiz":[{"q":"On a number line, $x>3$ is shown by:","options":["a closed circle at $3$","an open circle at $3$ with an arrow to the right","a closed circle with arrow left","a full line"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Open circle (excluded) + arrow right."},{"q":"A closed (filled) circle indicates the endpoint is:","options":["excluded","included","infinite","negative"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Included endpoint."},{"q":"An open circle indicates the endpoint is:","options":["included","excluded","doubled","zero"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Excluded endpoint."},{"q":"$x\\le5$ is shown with:","options":["an open circle at $5$","a closed circle at $5$ and arrow to the left","a closed circle and arrow right","no circle"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Closed at $5$, arrow left."}]}],"tests":{"online":{"title":"Online Test — Linear Inequations","minutes":15,"questions":[{"q":"Solve: x + 5 > 12","options":["x > 7","x > 17","x < 7","x < 17"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Subtract 5: x > 7","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"Solve: 3x ≤ 15","options":["x ≤ 5","x ≥ 5","x < 5","x > 5"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Divide by 3: x ≤ 5","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"When dividing by a negative number, the inequality sign:","options":["Stays same","Flips","Becomes equals","Disappears"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Multiplying/dividing by negative reverses the sign","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"The graph of x ≥ 2 has:","options":["Open circle at 2, arrow left","Open circle at 2, arrow right","Closed circle at 2, arrow left","Closed circle at 2, arrow right"],"correct":3,"explanation":"≥ means closed circle, arrow right (greater)","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"Solve: 4x − 7 > 2x + 5","options":["x > 6","x < 6","x > 2","x < 2"],"correct":0,"explanation":"4x−2x > 5+7 → 2x > 12 → x > 6","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"The graph of x < −1 has:","options":["Open circle at -1, arrow left","Open circle at -1, arrow right","Closed circle at -1, arrow left","Closed circle at -1, arrow right"],"correct":0,"explanation":"< means open circle, arrow left","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"Solve: −2x ≥ 10","options":["x ≥ −5","x ≤ −5","x ≥ 5","x ≤ 5"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Divide by −2 (flip sign): x ≤ −5","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"The compound inequality 2 < x < 5 means:","options":["x > 2 and x < 5","x > 2 or x < 5","x > 5 and x < 2","x > 5 or x < 2"],"correct":0,"explanation":"\"And\" means x between 2 and 5","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"Solve: 5(x − 3) ≤ 2x + 6","options":["x ≤ 7","x ≥ 7","x ≤ −7","x ≥ −7"],"correct":0,"explanation":"5x−15 ≤ 2x+6 → 3x ≤ 21 → x ≤ 7","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"The graph of x > 0 and x < 4 is:","options":["0 to 4, open circles","0 to 4, closed circles","0 to 4, arrows outward","Single point at 0"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Between 0 and 4, open circles at both ends","difficulty":"medium"}]},"imo":{"title":"IMO Practice — Linear Inequations","minutes":15,"questions":[{"q":"Solve: 3(x − 1) − 2(x + 3) > 2x − 7","options":["x < −2","x > −2","x < 2","x > 2"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Expand: $3(x-1)-2(x+3)=3x-3-2x-6=x-9$. So $x-9 > 2x-7 \\Rightarrow -9+7 > 2x-x \\Rightarrow -2 > x$, i.e. $x < -2$.","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"Find the greatest integer that satisfies: 3(2x − 5) < 5x + 2","options":["15","16","17","18"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Solve $3(2x-5) < 5x+2$: $6x-15 < 5x+2 \\Rightarrow x < 17$. The greatest integer satisfying $x < 17$ is $16$.","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"Solve: 2 ≤ (3x − 1)/2 < 5, x ∈ integers","options":["{2,3}","{2,3,4}","{1,2,3}","{1,2,3,4}"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Multiply by $2$: $4 \\le 3x-1 < 10$. Add $1$: $5 \\le 3x < 11$. Divide by $3$: $\\frac{5}{3} \\le x < \\frac{11}{3}$, i.e. $1.67 \\le x < 3.67$. The integer solutions are $\\{2,3\\}$.","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"The solution set of |x − 2| > 5 is:","options":["x < −3 or x > 7","−3 < x < 7","x < 7","x > −3"],"correct":0,"explanation":"$|x-2| > 5$ means $x-2 > 5$ or $x-2 < -5$. The first gives $x > 7$; the second gives $x < -3$. So the solution set is $x < -3$ or $x > 7$.","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"If x is an integer, how many integers satisfy 2x − 7 < x + 3 ≤ 3x − 5?","options":["4","5","6","7"],"correct":2,"explanation":"From $2x-7 < x+3$ we get $x < 10$. From $x+3 \\le 3x-5$ we get $8 \\le 2x$, i.e. $x \\ge 4$. So $4 \\le x < 10$, giving the integers $4,5,6,7,8,9$ — that is $6$ integers.","difficulty":"medium"},{"q":"Represent the solution of 4x − 7 ≥ 3x + 5 on a number line. The graph shows:","options":["Closed circle at 12, arrow right","Open circle at 12, arrow right","Closed circle at 12, arrow left","Open circle at 12, arrow left"],"correct":0,"explanation":"4x−3x ≥ 5+7 → x ≥ 12 → closed circle at 12, arrow right","difficulty":"medium"}]}}}